[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Stolen Plans</h2>
<i>Guldan: ~wWake up!!!</i><br>
<i>You: ~wWhat?  I'm so sleepy.<br>
<i>Guldan: ~wThat was a spell, the stole all your plans of technology while you were sleeping.<br>
<i>You: ~wWHAT!?!?!?<br>
<i>Guldan: ~.They only stole a couple of mine, but they had to fight for it.  Looks like I have to give them to you.<br>
<i>^WaR^ Leader: ~wHere's some of my plans, they didn't get any.<br>
<i>Guldan: ~wAll you have to do is take there plans.  Engage in these four near by enemies to the north.  When you kill the preist you might get a plan, if not, level their temple and search the ground.<br>
<p>Well, it looks like this might be a challenge.

$Button=What you got, what you don't,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Start Fighting,DoNothing,0

[Succeeded][BadTeamDead]
<p>Yes, but some of these plans don't have a generator plan with them, looks like we have to fight some more.
